msgstr "無邊框視窗 (可用於全螢幕或非全螢幕)。"

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:640
msgid "Ability to keep a window always on top."
msgstr "可將視窗設為總是在最頂端。"

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:641
msgid "Global menu integration on macOS."
