msgstr ":ref:`Stack <class_BoxContainer>` 配置。"

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:707
msgid ":ref:`Grid <class_GridContainer>` layouts."
msgstr ":ref:`Grid <class_GridContainer>` 配置。"

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:708
msgid ""
":ref:`Flow <class_FlowContainer>` layouts (similar to autowrapping text)."
msgstr ":ref:`Flow <class_FlowContainer>` 排版（類似自動換行文字）。"

#: ../../docs/about/list_of_features.rst:709
msgid ""
":ref:`Margin <class_MarginContainer>`, :ref:`centered "
"<class_CenterContainer>` and :ref:`aspect ratio "
"<class_AspectRatioContainer>` layouts."
msgstr ""
":ref:`外邊距 <class_MarginContainer>`、:ref:`置中 <class_CenterContainer>` "
