"threads/thread_model>` for more details."
msgstr ""
"|release| 算繪執行緒模式（「unsafe」、「safe」、「separate」）。詳"
"見 :ref:`Thread Model <class_ProjectSettings_property_rendering/driver/"
"threads/thread_model>` 以取得更多資訊。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:98
msgid "``--remote-fs <address>``"
msgstr "``--remote-fs <address>``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:98
msgid "|release| Remote filesystem (``<host/IP>[:<port>]`` address)."
msgstr "遠端檔案系統（ ``<host/IP>[:<port>]`` 位址）。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:100
msgid "``--remote-fs-password <password>``"
msgstr "``--remote-fs <address>``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:100
msgid "|release| Password for remote filesystem."
msgstr "|release| 遠端檔案系統密碼。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:102
msgid "``--audio-driver <driver>``"
msgstr "``--audio-driver <driver>``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:102
msgid ""
"|release| Audio driver. Use ``--help`` first to display the list of "
"available drivers."
msgstr "音效驅動程式。先指定 ``--help`` 以顯示所有可用的驅動程式。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:104
msgid "``--display-driver <driver>``"
msgstr "``--audio-driver <driver>``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:104
msgid ""
"|release| Display driver (and rendering driver). Use ``--help`` first to "
"display the list of available drivers."
msgstr "視訊驅動程式。先指定 ``--help`` 以顯示所有可用的驅動程式。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:106
msgid "``--audio-output-latency`` <ms>"
msgstr "``--audio-output-latency`` <ms>"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:106
msgid ""
"|release| Override audio output latency in milliseconds (default is 15 ms). "
"Lower values make sound playback more reactive but increase CPU usage, and "
"may result in audio cracking if the CPU can't keep up"
msgstr ""
"|release| 覆寫音訊輸出延遲（毫秒，預設為 15 ms）。較低的數值可提升回應性，但"
"會增加 CPU 使用率；若 CPU 無法負荷，可能導致聲音破音"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:109
msgid "``--rendering-method <renderer>``"
msgstr "``--render-thread <mode>``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:109
msgid "|release| Renderer name. Requires driver support."
msgstr "|release|算繪器名稱。需要驅動程式支援。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:111
msgid "``--rendering-driver <driver>``"
msgstr "``--audio-driver <driver>``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:111
msgid ""
"|release| Rendering driver (depends on display driver). Use ``--help`` first "
"to display the list of available drivers."
msgstr "視訊驅動程式。先指定 ``--help`` 以顯示所有可用的驅動程式。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:113
msgid "``--gpu-index <device_index>``"
msgstr "``--gpu-index <裝置索引>``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:113
msgid ""
"|release| Use a specific GPU (run with ``--verbose`` to get available device "
"list)."
msgstr "|release|使用特定的 GPU（使用“--verbose”運作以取得可用裝置列表）。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:115
msgid "``--text-driver <driver>``"
msgstr "``--video-driver <driver>``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:115
msgid "|release| Text driver (Fonts, BiDi, shaping)."
msgstr "|release|文字驅動程式（字形、BiDi、整形）。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:117
msgid "``--tablet-driver <driver>``"
msgstr "``--audio-driver <driver>``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:117
msgid "|release| Pen tablet input driver."
msgstr "|release|手寫板輸入驅動程式。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:119
msgid "``--headless``"
msgstr "``--remote-fs <address>``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:119
msgid ""
"|release| Enable headless mode (``--display-driver headless --audio-driver "
"Dummy``). Useful for servers and with ``--script``."
msgstr ""
"|release|啟用無頭模式（``--display-driver headless --audio-driver Dummy``）。"
"對於伺服器和“--script”很有用。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:121
msgid "``--log-file``"
msgstr "``--log-file``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:121
msgid ""
"|release| Write output/error log to the specified path instead of the "
"default location defined by the project. <file> path should be absolute or "
"relative to the project directory."
msgstr ""
"|release| 將輸出/錯誤日誌寫入指定路徑，而非專案預設位置。<file> 路徑可為絕對"
"路徑或相對於專案目錄的路徑 。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:124
msgid "``--write-movie <file>``"
msgstr "``--main-pack <file>``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:124
msgid ""
"|release| Run the engine in a way that a movie is written (usually with .avi "
"or .png extension). ``--fixed-fps`` is forced when enabled, but can be used "
"to change movie FPS. ``--disable-vsync`` can speed up movie writing but "
"makes interaction more difficult. ``--quit-after`` can be used to specify "
"the number of frames to write."
msgstr ""
"|release| 以電影寫入的方式執行引擎（通常使用 .avi 或 .png 副檔名）. 啟用時會"
"強制使用 ``--fixed-fps``, 但可用於更改電影的每秒影格數（FPS）. ``--disable-"
"vsync`` 可以加快電影寫入速度，但會使互動更加困難. ``--quit-after`` 可用於指定"
"要寫入的影格數."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:130
msgid "**Display options**"
msgstr "**顯示選項**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:135
msgid "``-f``, ``--fullscreen``"
msgstr "``-f``, ``--fullscreen``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:135
msgid "|release| Request fullscreen mode."
msgstr "指定全螢幕模式。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:137
msgid "``-m``, ``--maximized``"
msgstr "``-m``, ``--maximized``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:137
msgid "|release| Request a maximized window."
msgstr "指定視窗最大化。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:139
msgid "``-w``, ``--windowed``"
msgstr "``-w``, ``--windowed``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:139
msgid "|release| Request windowed mode."
msgstr "指定視窗模式。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:141
msgid "``-t``, ``--always-on-top``"
msgstr "``-t``, ``--always-on-top``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:141
msgid "|release| Request an always-on-top window."
msgstr "指定永遠顯示於最上層之視窗。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:143
msgid "``--resolution <W>x<H>``"
msgstr "``--resolution <W>x<H>``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:143
msgid "|release| Request window resolution."
msgstr "指定視窗解析度。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:145
msgid "``--position <X>,<Y>``"
msgstr "``--position <X>,<Y>``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:145
msgid "|release| Request window position."
msgstr "指定視窗位置。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:147
msgid "``--screen <N>``"
msgstr "``--frame-delay <ms>``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:147
msgid "|release| Request window screen."
msgstr "指定視窗解析度。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:149
msgid "``--single-window``"
msgstr "``--no-window``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:149
msgid "|release| Use a single window (no separate subwindows)."
msgstr "|release|使用單一視窗（沒有單獨的子視窗）。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:151
msgid "``--xr-mode <mode>``"
msgstr "``--render-thread <mode>``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:151
msgid "|release| Select XR mode ('default', 'off', 'on')."
msgstr "|release|選擇 XR 模式（“預設”、“關閉”、“開啟”）。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:153
msgid "``--wid <window_id>``"
msgstr "``--wid <window_id>``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:153
msgid "|release| Request parented to window."
msgstr "|release| 要求將視窗隸屬於指定的父視窗 。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:155
msgid "``--accessibility <mode>``"
msgstr "``--accessibility <mode>``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:155
msgid ""
"|release| Select accessibility mode ['auto' (when screen reader is running, "
"default), 'always', 'disabled']."
msgstr ""
"|release| 選擇無障礙模式 ['auto'（當螢幕報讀程式執行時，預"
"設）、'always'、'disabled'] 。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:159
msgid "**Debug options**"
msgstr "**偵錯選項**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:164
msgid "``-d``, ``--debug``"
msgstr "``-d``, ``--debug``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:164
msgid "|release| Debug (local stdout debugger)."
msgstr "除錯（本機標準輸出 (Stdout) 除錯工具）。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:166
msgid "``-b``, ``--breakpoints``"
msgstr "``-b``, ``--breakpoints``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:166
msgid ""
"|release| Breakpoint list as source::line comma-separated pairs, no spaces "
"(use ``%20`` instead)."
msgstr "以 source::line，逗號分隔配對，無空白（顯示 %%20）來列出中斷點。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:168
msgid "``--ignore-error-breaks``"
msgstr "``--ignore-error-breaks``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:168
msgid "|release| If debugger is connected, prevents sending error breakpoints."
msgstr "|release| 若偵錯器已連線，則避免傳送錯誤中斷點 。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:170
msgid "``--profiling``"
msgstr "``--profiling``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:170
msgid "|release| Enable profiling in the script debugger."
msgstr "在腳本除錯工具中啟用分析。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:172
msgid "``--gpu-profile``"
msgstr "``--profiling``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:172
msgid ""
"|release| Show a GPU profile of the tasks that took the most time during "
"frame rendering."
msgstr "|release|顯示影格算繪期間花費最多時間的工作的 GPU 設定檔。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:174
msgid "``--gpu-validation``"
msgstr "``--debug-navigation``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:174
msgid ""
"|release| Enable graphics API :ref:`validation layers "
"<doc_vulkan_validation_layers>` for debugging."
msgstr ""
"|release|啟用圖形 API :ref:`驗證層 <doc_vulkan_validation_layers>` 進行除錯。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:176
msgid "``--gpu-abort``"
msgstr "``--quiet``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:176
msgid ""
"|debug| Abort on GPU errors (usually validation layer errors), may help see "
"the problem if your system freezes."
msgstr ""
"|debug|在 GPU 錯誤（通常是驗證層錯誤）時中止，可能有助於在系統凍結時發現問"
"題。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:178
msgid "``--generate-spirv-debug-info``"
msgstr "``--generate-spirv-debug-info``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:178
msgid ""
"|debug| Generate SPIR-V debug information. This allows source-level shader "
"debugging with RenderDoc."
msgstr ""
"|debug| 產生 SPIR-V 除錯資訊。可配合 RenderDoc 進行著色器原始碼層級的除錯 。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:180
msgid "``--extra-gpu-memory-tracking``"
msgstr "``--extra-gpu-memory-tracking``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:180
msgid ""
"|debug| Enables additional memory tracking (see class reference for "
"`RenderingDevice.get_driver_and_device_memory_report()` and linked methods). "
"Currently only implemented for Vulkan. Enabling this feature may cause "
"crashes on some systems due to buggy drivers or bugs in the Vulkan Loader. "
"See https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/95967"
msgstr ""
"|debug| 啟用額外的記憶體追蹤（詳見類別參考中的 "
"`RenderingDevice.get_driver_and_device_memory_report()` 及相關方法） 。目前僅"
"在 Vulkan 上實作。由於驅動或 Vulkan Loader 的問題，在部分系統上啟用此功能可能"
"導致當機。請參考 https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/95967"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:185
msgid "``--accurate-breadcrumbs``"
msgstr "``--accurate-breadcrumbs``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:185
msgid ""
"|debug| Force barriers between breadcrumbs. Useful for narrowing down a "
"command causing GPU resets. Currently only implemented for Vulkan."
msgstr ""
"|debug| 在 breadcrumbs 之間強制加入 barrier。 可用於縮小導致 GPU 重置的命令範"
"圍。 目前僅在 Vulkan 上實作。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:188
msgid "``--remote-debug <uri>``"
msgstr "``--remote-debug <address>``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:188
msgid ""
"|release| Remote debug (``<protocol>://<host/IP>[:<port>]``, e.g. ``tcp://"
"127.0.0.1:6007``)."
msgstr ""
"|release|遠端偵錯（``<協定>://<主機/IP>[:<連接埠>]``，例如``tcp://"
"127.0.0.1:6007``）。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:190
msgid "``--single-threaded-scene``"
msgstr "``--render-thread <mode>``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:190
msgid ""
"|release| Scene tree runs in single-threaded mode. Sub-thread groups are "
"disabled and run on the main thread."
msgstr "|release|場景樹以單執行緒模式運作。子線程組被禁用並在主線程上運作。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:192
msgid "``--debug-collisions``"
msgstr "``--debug-collisions``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:192
msgid "|debug| Show collision shapes when running the scene."
msgstr "執行場景時顯示碰撞區域。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:194
msgid "``--debug-paths``"
msgstr "``--debug-navigation``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:194
msgid "|debug| Show path lines when running the scene."
msgstr "執行場景時顯示碰撞區域。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:196
msgid "``--debug-navigation``"
msgstr "``--debug-navigation``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:196
msgid "|debug| Show navigation polygons when running the scene."
msgstr "執行場景時顯示導覽多邊形。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:198
msgid "``--debug-avoidance``"
msgstr "``--debug-navigation``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:198
msgid "|debug| Show navigation avoidance debug visuals when running the scene."
msgstr "執行場景時顯示導覽多邊形。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:200
msgid "``--debug-stringnames``"
msgstr "``--debug-collisions``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:200
msgid ""
"|debug| Print all StringName allocations to stdout when the engine quits."
msgstr "|debug|當引擎退出時，將所有 StringName 分配列印到標準輸出。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:202
msgid "``--debug-canvas-item-redraw``"
msgstr "``--debug-canvas-item-redraw``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:202
msgid ""
"|debug| Display a rectangle each time a canvas item requests a redraw "
"(useful to troubleshoot low processor mode)."
msgstr ""
"|debug| 每當畫布項目請求重繪時顯示一個矩形 （在低處理器模式下除錯很有用）。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:205
msgid "``--max-fps <fps>``"
msgstr "``--max-fps <fps>``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:205
msgid ""
"|release| Set a maximum number of frames per second rendered (can be used to "
"limit power usage). A value of 0 results in unlimited framerate."
msgstr ""
"|release| 設定最高每秒影格數（可用於限制耗電）。 數值為 0 代表不限制幀率。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:208
msgid "``--frame-delay <ms>``"
msgstr "``--frame-delay <ms>``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:208
msgid ""
"|release| Simulate high CPU load (delay each frame by <ms> milliseconds). Do "
"not use as a FPS limiter; use --max-fps instead."
msgstr ""
"|release| 模擬高 CPU 負載（每個影格延遲 <ms> 毫秒）。 請勿用作 FPS 限制器；若"
"要限制請使用 --max-fps。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:211
msgid "``--time-scale <scale>``"
msgstr "``--time-scale <scale>``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:211
msgid ""
"|release| Force time scale (higher values are faster, 1.0 is normal speed)."
msgstr "強制時間縮放（值越早則越快，1.0 為正常速度）。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:213
msgid "``--disable-vsync``"
msgstr "``--disable-crash-handler``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:213
msgid ""
"|release| Forces disabling of vertical synchronization, even if enabled in "
"the project settings. Does not override driver-level V-Sync enforcement."
msgstr ""
"|release| 強制停用垂直同步, 即使專案設定中已啟用. 不會覆寫驅動程式層級的垂直"
"同步強制設定."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:216
msgid "``--disable-render-loop``"
msgstr "``--disable-render-loop``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:216
msgid ""
"|release| Disable render loop so rendering only occurs when called "
"explicitly from script."
msgstr "禁用算繪循環，將只在腳本內明確呼叫時才進行算繪。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:218
msgid "``--disable-crash-handler``"
msgstr "``--disable-crash-handler``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:218
msgid "|release| Disable crash handler when supported by the platform code."
msgstr "若平台程式碼支援，禁用 Crash Handler。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:220
msgid "``--fixed-fps <fps>``"
msgstr "``--fixed-fps <fps>``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:220
msgid ""
"|release| Force a fixed number of frames per second. This setting disables "
"real-time synchronization."
msgstr "強制固定數 FPS。該設定將禁用即時同步。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:222
msgid "``--delta-smoothing <enable>``"
msgstr "``--delta-smoothing <啟用>``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:222
msgid ""
"|release| Enable or disable frame delta smoothing ('enable', 'disable')."
msgstr "|release| 啟用或停用幀差平滑化 ('enable', 'disable')。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:224
msgid "``--print-fps``"
msgstr "``--print-fps``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:224
msgid "|release| Print the frames per second to the stdout."
msgstr "在標準輸出上印出 FPS。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:226
msgid "``--editor-pseudolocalization``"
msgstr "``--editor-pseudolocalization``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:226
msgid ""
"|editor| Enable pseudolocalization for the editor and the project manager."
msgstr "|editor| 為編輯器與專案管理員啟用偽本地化。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:229
msgid "**Standalone tools**"
msgstr "**獨立工具**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:234
msgid "``-s``, ``--script <script>``"
msgstr "``-s <script>``, ``--script <script>``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:234
msgid ""
"|release| Run a script. ``<script>`` must be a resource path relative to the "
"project (``myscript.gd`` will be interpreted as ``res://myscript.gd``) or an "
"absolute filesystem path (for example on Windows ``C:/tmp/myscript.gd``)"
msgstr ""
"|release| 執行腳本。 ``<script>`` 必須是相對於專案的資源路徑 "
"(``myscript.gd`` 將會被解釋為 ``res://myscript.gd``)，或是絕對檔案系統路徑 "
"(例如在 Windows 上為 ``C:/tmp/myscript.gd``)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:237
msgid "``--main-loop <main_loop_name>``"
msgstr "``--main-loop <main_loop_name>``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:237
msgid "|release| Run a MainLoop specified by its global class name."
msgstr "|release| 以全域類別名稱執行指定的 MainLoop."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:239
msgid "``--check-only``"
msgstr "``--check-only``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:239
msgid "|release| Only parse for errors and quit (use with ``--script``)."
msgstr "僅解析錯誤並退出（與 ``--script`` 一起使用）。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:241
msgid "``--import``"
msgstr "``--import``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:241
msgid ""
"|editor| Starts the editor, waits for any resources to be imported, and then "
"quits. Implies ``--editor`` and ``--quit``."
msgstr ""
"|editor| 啟動編輯器, 等待所有資源匯入完成，然後結束。表示包含 ``--editor`` "
"和 ``--quit``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:243
msgid "``--export-release <preset> <path>``"
msgstr "``--export-pack <preset> <path>``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:243
msgid ""
"|editor| Export the project in release mode using the given preset and "
"output path. The preset name should match one defined in "
"'export_presets.cfg'. ``<path>`` should be absolute or relative to the "
"project directory, and include the filename for the binary (e.g. 'builds/"
"game.exe'). The target directory must exist."
msgstr ""
"|editor| 使用指定的預設與輸出路徑，以 release 模式匯出專案。 預設名稱需與 "
"'export_presets.cfg' 中定義的相符。 ``<path>`` 應為絕對路徑或相對於專案目錄的"
"路徑，且需包含產出二進位的檔名（例如 'builds/game.exe'）。 目標目錄必須已存"
"在。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:247
msgid "``--export-debug <preset> <path>``"
msgstr "``--export-pack <preset> <path>``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:247
msgid ""
"|editor| Like ``--export-release``, but use debug template. Implies ``--"
"import``."
msgstr ""
"|editor| 類似 ``--export-release``, 但使用除錯範本. 包含 ``--import`` 的效果."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:249
msgid "``--export-pack <preset> <path>``"
msgstr "``--export-pack <preset> <path>``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:249
msgid ""
"|editor| Like ``--export-release``, but only export the game pack for the "
"given preset. The ``<path>`` extension determines whether it will be in PCK "
"or ZIP format. Implies ``--import``."
msgstr ""
"|editor| 類似 ``--export-release``, 但僅匯出指定預設的遊戲包. ``<路徑>`` 的副"
"檔名決定了格式為 PCK 或 ZIP。隱含 ``--import``."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:252
msgid "``--export-patch <preset> <path>``"
msgstr "``--export-patch <preset> <path>``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:252
msgid ""
"|editor| Export pack with changed files only. See --export-pack description "
"for other considerations."
msgstr ""
"|editor| 只匯出變更過的檔案作為資料包。 其他注意事項請參考 --export-pack 的說"
"明。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:254
msgid "``--patches <paths>``"
msgstr "``--patches <paths>``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:254
msgid ""
"|editor| List of patches to use with --export-patch. The list is comma-"
"separated."
msgstr "|editor| 與 --export-patch 一起使用的補丁列表，以逗號分隔."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:256
msgid "``--install-android-build-template``"
msgstr "``--install-android-build-template``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:256
msgid ""
"|editor| Install the Android build template. Used in conjunction with --"
"export-release or --export-debug."
msgstr ""
"|editor| 安裝 Android 建置範本。 可與 --export-release 或 --export-debug 搭配"
"使用。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:258
msgid "``--convert-3to4 [<max_file_kb>] [<max_line_size>]``"
msgstr "``--convert-3to4 [<最大檔案kb值>] [<最大行數>]``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:258
msgid "|editor| Convert project from Godot 3.x to Godot 4.x."
msgstr "|editor| 將專案從 Godot 3.x 轉換為 Godot 4.x。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:260
msgid "``--validate-conversion-3to4 [<max_file_kb>] [<max_line_size>]``"
msgstr "``--validate-conversion-3to4 [<最大檔案kb值>] [<最大行數>]``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:260
msgid ""
"|editor| Show what elements will be renamed when converting project from "
"Godot 3.x to Godot 4.x."
msgstr "|editor| 顯示將專案從 Godot 3.x 轉換到 Godot 4.x 時會重新命名的元素."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:262
msgid "``--doctool [<path>]``"
msgstr "``--doctool <path>``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:262
msgid ""
"|editor| Dump the engine API reference to the given ``<path>`` in XML "
"format, merging if existing files are found."
msgstr ""
"|editor| 將引擎 API 參考以 XML 格式傾印至指定的 ``<path>``, 如果找到現有檔案"
"則合併."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:264
msgid "``--no-docbase``"
msgstr "``--no-docbase``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:264
msgid "|editor| Disallow dumping the base types (used with ``--doctool``)."
msgstr "|editor| 禁止傾印基礎型別（與 ``--doctool`` 搭配使用）。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:266
msgid "``--gdscript-docs <path>``"
msgstr "``--doctool <path>``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:266
msgid ""
"|editor| Rather than dumping the engine API, generate API reference from the "
"inline documentation in the GDScript files found in <path> (used with ``--"
"doctool``)."
msgstr ""
"|editor| 不要傾印引擎 API，而是從 <path> 中 GDScript 檔案的內聯文件產生 API "
"參考（搭配 ``--doctool`` 使用）."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:269
msgid "``--build-solutions``"
msgstr "``--build-solutions``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:269
msgid ""
"|editor| Build the scripting solutions (e.g. for C# projects). Implies ``--"
"editor`` and requires a valid project to edit."
msgstr ""
"|editor| 建置腳本解決方案（例如 C# 專案）. 包含 ``--editor`` 並需要一個可編輯"
"的有效專案."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:271
msgid "``--dump-gdextension-interface``"
msgstr "``--dump-gdextension-interface``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:271
msgid ""
"|editor| Generate GDExtension header file 'gdnative_interface.h' in the "
"current folder. This file is the base file required to implement a "
"GDExtension."
msgstr ""
"|editor| 在目前資料夾產生 GDExtension 標頭檔 'gdnative_interface.h'. 這個檔案"
"是實作 GDExtension 所需的基礎檔案."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:273
msgid "``--dump-extension-api``"
msgstr "``--gdnative-generate-json-api``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:273
msgid ""
"|editor| Generate JSON dump of the Godot API for GDExtension bindings named "
"'extension_api.json' in the current folder."
msgstr ""
"|editor| 在目前資料夾產生名為 'extension_api.json' 的 Godot API JSON 傾印, 用"
"於 GDExtension 綁定."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:275
msgid "``--validate-extension-api <path>``"
msgstr "``--gdnative-generate-json-api``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:275
msgid ""
"|editor| Validate an extension API file dumped (with the option above) from "
"a previous version of the engine to ensure API compatibility. If "
"incompatibilities or errors are detected, the return code will be non-zero."
msgstr ""
"|editor| 驗證從舊版引擎傾印（使用上述選項）的擴充功能 API 檔案, 以確保 API 相"
"容性. 如果偵測到不相容或錯誤，回傳碼將為非零."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:278
msgid "``--benchmark``"
msgstr "``--benchmark``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:278
msgid "|editor| Benchmark the run time and print it to console."
msgstr "|editor|對運作時間進行基準測試並將其列印到控制台。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:280
msgid "``--benchmark-file <path>``"
msgstr "``--doctool <path>``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:280
msgid ""
"|editor| Benchmark the run time and save it to a given file in JSON format. "
"The path should be absolute."
msgstr ""
"|editor|對運作時間進行基準測試並將其以 JSON 格式儲存到給定檔案中。該路徑應該"
"是絕對的。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:282
msgid "``--test [--help]``"
msgstr "``--test [--help]``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:282
msgid "|editor| Run unit tests. Use --test --help for more information."
msgstr "|editor| 執行單元測試。 使用 --test --help 以取得更多資訊。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:287
msgid "Path"
msgstr "路徑"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:289
msgid ""
"It is recommended to place your Godot editor binary in your ``PATH`` "
"environment variable, so it can be executed easily from any place by typing "
"``godot``. You can do so on Linux by placing the Godot binary in ``/usr/"
"local/bin`` and making sure it is called ``godot`` (case-sensitive)."
msgstr ""
"建議將 Godot 二進位執行檔放置於 PATH 環境變數內，這樣在任何地方就只需要輸入 "
"``godot`` 即可執行。在 Linux 中可以將 Godot 二進位執行檔放在 ``/usr/local/"
"bin`` 並確保該檔案命名為 ``godot`` 。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:294
msgid ""
"To achieve this on Windows or macOS easily, you can install Godot using "
"`Scoop <https://scoop.sh>`__ (on Windows) or `Homebrew <https://brew.sh>`__ "
"(on macOS). This will automatically make the copy of Godot installed "
"available in the ``PATH``:"
msgstr ""
"要在 Windows 或 macOS 上輕鬆實作這一目標，可以使用 `Scoop <https://"
"scoop.sh>`__（在 Windows 上）或 `Homebrew <https://brew.sh>`__（在 macOS 上）"
"安裝 Godot。這將自動在 ``PATH`` 中提供已安裝的 Godot 副本："

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:321
msgid "Setting the project path"
msgstr "設定專案路徑"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:323
msgid ""
"Depending on where your Godot binary is located and what your current "
"working directory is, you may need to set the path to your project for any "
"of the following commands to work correctly."
msgstr ""
"依據 Godot 的二進位執行檔放置位置以及目前工作目錄的不同，可能需要為下列指令設"
"定專案路徑才可正確執行。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:327
msgid ""
"When running the editor, this can be done by giving the path to the "
"``project.godot`` file of your project as either the first argument, like "
"this:"
msgstr ""
"執行編輯器時，這可以透過給定您的專案的 ``project.godot`` 檔案路徑作為第一個引"
"數來完成，像這樣："

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:334
msgid "For all commands, this can be done by using the ``--path`` argument:"
msgstr "對於所有指令，這可以透過使用 ``--path`` 引數來完成："

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:340
msgid ""
"For example, the full command for exporting your game (as explained below) "
"might look like this:"
msgstr "舉例來說，用於匯出遊戲（下方會說明）的完整指令看起來會像這樣："

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:346
msgid ""
"When starting from a subdirectory of your project, use the ``--upwards`` "
"argument for Godot to automatically find the ``project.godot`` file by "
"recursively searching the parent directories."
msgstr ""
"當從您的專案子目錄啟動時，請使用 ``--upwards`` 引數，讓 Godot 透過遞迴搜尋父"
"目錄來自動找到 ``project.godot`` 檔案。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:349
msgid ""
"For example, running a scene (as explained below) nested in a subdirectory "
"might look like this when your working directory is in the same path:"
msgstr ""
"例如，當您的工作目錄與巢狀於子目錄中的場景 (如下所述) 在相同路徑時，執行該場"
"景可能看起來像這樣："

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:360
msgid "Creating a project"
msgstr "建立專案"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:363
msgid ""
"Creating a project from the command line can be done by navigating the shell "
"to the desired place and making a ``project.godot`` file."
msgstr ""
"可以通過將 Shell 導覽至欲建立專案的位置並建立 project.godot 檔案來在命令列中"
"建立專案。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:374
msgid "The project can now be opened with Godot."
msgstr "該專案即可以 Godot 開啟。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:378
msgid "Running the editor"
msgstr "執行編輯器"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:380
msgid ""
"Running the editor is done by executing Godot with the ``-e`` flag. This "
"must be done from within the project directory or by setting the project "
"path as explained above, otherwise the command is ignored and the Project "
"Manager appears."
msgstr ""
"執行編輯器是透過使用 ``-e`` 旗標執行 Godot 來完成的。這必須在專案目錄內執行，"
"或透過設定如上所述的專案路徑，否則指令將被忽略並且專案管理器會出現。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:388
msgid ""
"When passing in the full path to the ``project.godot`` file, the ``-e`` flag "
"may be omitted."
msgstr "當傳入 ``project.godot`` 檔案的完整路徑時，可以省略 ``-e`` 旗標。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:390
msgid ""
"If a scene has been created and saved, it can be edited later by running the "
"same code with that scene as argument."
msgstr "若已有建立並保存場景，則之後可使用相同的指令並以該場景作為參數來編輯。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:398
msgid "Erasing a scene"
msgstr "清除場景"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:400
msgid ""
"Godot is friends with your filesystem and will not create extra metadata "
"files. Use ``rm`` to erase a scene file. Make sure nothing references that "
"scene. Otherwise, an error will be thrown upon opening the project."
msgstr ""
"Godot 對檔案系統友善，且不會建立額外的後設資料檔案。可使用 ``rm`` 來清除專案"
"檔案。請確保沒有其他東西參照到該場景，否則開啟時會拋出錯誤。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:409
msgid "Running the game"
msgstr "執行遊戲"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:411
msgid ""
"To run the game, execute Godot within the project directory or with the "
"project path as explained above."
msgstr "若要執行遊戲，請在專案目錄內執行 Godot，或使用如上所述的專案路徑。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:417
msgid ""
"Note that passing in the ``project.godot`` file will always run the editor "
"instead of running the game."
msgstr "請注意，傳入 ``project.godot`` 檔案將總是會執行編輯器，而非執行遊戲。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:419
msgid ""
"When a specific scene needs to be tested, pass that scene to the command "
"line."
msgstr "若需要測試特定的場景，則可將該場景傳入命令列。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:426
#: ../../docs/tutorials/export/exporting_for_macos.rst:179
#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/web/customizing_html5_shell.rst:216
#: ../../docs/tutorials/plugins/running_code_in_the_editor.rst:137
#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/debugging/index.rst:4
msgid "Debugging"
msgstr "除錯"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:428
msgid ""
"Catching errors in the command line can be a difficult task because they "
"scroll quickly. For this, a command line debugger is provided by adding ``-"
"d``. It works for running either the game or a single scene."
msgstr ""
"在命令列中找出錯誤可能很困難。為此，可以通過加上 ``-d`` 參數來使用命令列除錯"
"工具。該工具可以用於執行遊戲或場景。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:445
msgid ""
"Exporting the project from the command line is also supported. This is "
"especially useful for continuous integration setups."
msgstr ""
"Godot 亦支援自命令列匯出專案。對於 CI 環境（持續整合, Continuous "
"Integration）設定特別有用。無周邊版本的 Godot （伺服器建置，無視訊功能）亦是"
"最佳選擇。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:450
msgid ""
"Using the ``--headless`` command line argument is **required** on platforms "
"that do not have GPU access (such as continuous integration). On platforms "
"with GPU access, ``--headless`` prevents a window from spawning while the "
"project is exporting."
msgstr ""
"在沒有 GPU 存取權限的平臺上（如持續集成），必須使用 ``--headless`` 命令列參"
"數。在有 GPU 存取權限的平臺上， ``--headless`` 可阻止在匯出專案時生成視窗。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:463
msgid ""
"The preset name must match the name of an export preset defined in the "
"project's ``export_presets.cfg`` file. If the preset name contains spaces or "
"special characters (such as \"Windows Desktop\"), it must be surrounded with "
"quotes."
msgstr ""
"預設名稱必須與專案的 ``export_presets.cfg`` 檔中定義的匯出預設名稱一致. 如果"
"預設名稱包含空格或特殊字元(如 \"Windows Desktop\"), 必須用引號引起來."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:467
msgid ""
"To export a debug version of the game, use the ``--export-debug`` switch "
"instead of ``--export-release``. Their parameters and usage are the same."
msgstr ""
"欲匯出除錯版本的遊戲，請使用 ``--export-debug`` 而非 ``--export`` 。其參數與"
"用法皆相同。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:470
msgid ""
"To export only a PCK file, use the ``--export-pack`` option followed by the "
"preset name and output path, with the file extension, instead of ``--export-"
"release`` or ``--export-debug``. The output path extension determines the "
"package's format, either PCK or ZIP."
msgstr ""
"如果只要匯出 PCK 檔案，可以將 ``--export`` 改成 ``--export-pack`` 選項，然後"
"接上匯出預設設定的名稱與輸出路徑，並加上副檔名。輸出路徑的副檔名是依據套件格"
"式判斷的，必須為 PCK 或 ZIP 其一。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:477
msgid ""
"When specifying a relative path as the path for ``--export-release``, ``--"
"export-debug`` or ``--export-pack``, the path will be relative to the "
"directory containing the ``project.godot`` file, **not** relative to the "
"current working directory."
msgstr ""
"當指定相對路徑作為 `--export`、`--export-debug`、`--export-pack` 的路徑時，該"
"路徑將是相對於包含 ``project.godot`` 檔的目錄，而**不是**相對於目前工作目錄。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:482
msgid "Running a script"
msgstr "執行腳本"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:484
msgid ""
"It is possible to run a ``.gd`` script from the command line. This feature "
"is especially useful in large projects, e.g. for batch conversion of assets "
"or custom import/export."
msgstr ""
"可欲命令列中執行簡單的 ``.gd`` 腳本。對於大型專案來說特別有用，如大量的素材轉"
"換或自定匯入／匯出。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:488
msgid "The script must inherit from ``SceneTree`` or ``MainLoop``."
msgstr "該腳本必須繼承 ``SceneTree`` 或 ``MainLoop`` 。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:490
msgid "Here is an example ``sayhello.gd``, showing how it works:"
msgstr "下列為一個簡單的 ``sayhello.gd`` 範例，用來說明如何運作："

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:501
msgid "And how to run it:"
msgstr "以及如何執行："

#: ../../docs/tutorials/editor/command_line_tutorial.rst:508
msgid ""
"If no ``project.godot`` exists at the path, current path is assumed to be "
"the current working directory (unless ``--path`` is specified)."
msgstr ""
"若路徑中無 ``project.godot`` ，則目前的路徑將被視為目前的工作目錄（除非指定 "
"``--path`` ）。"

