#: ../../docs/tutorials/migrating/upgrading_to_godot_4.4.rst:180
msgid ""
"The ``Curve`` resource now enforces its value range, so ``min_value`` and "
"``max_value`` need to be changed if any of the points fall outside of the "
"default ``[0, 1]`` range."
