#: ../../docs/tutorials/export/exporting_for_ios.rst:92
msgid "Start from an exported iOS project (follow the steps above)."
msgstr "先從匯出的 iOS 專案開始 (依照上面的步驟)。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/export/exporting_for_ios.rst:93
msgid "In Finder, drag the Godot project folder into the Xcode file browser."
msgstr "在 Finder 中，將 Godot 專案資料夾拖曳到 Xcode 檔案瀏覽器中。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/export/exporting_for_ios.rst:97
msgid ""
"In the dialog, make sure to select Action: **Reference files in place** and "
"Groups: **Create folders**. Uncheck Targets: **exported_xcode_project_name**."
msgstr ""
"在對話方塊中，請確保選擇 Action：**Reference files in place**，以及 Groups："
"**Create folders**。取消勾選 Targets：**exported_xcode_project_name**。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/export/exporting_for_ios.rst:101
msgid "See the **godot_project_to_export** folder in the Xcode file browser."
msgstr "在 Xcode 檔案瀏覽器中檢視 **godot_project_to_export** 資料夾。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/export/exporting_for_ios.rst:103
msgid ""
"Select the godot project in the Project navigator. Then on the other side of "
"the XCode window, in the File Inspector, make these selections:"
msgstr ""
"在 Project 導覽器中選取 godot 專案。接著在 Xcode 視窗右側的 File Inspector "
"中，做以下選擇："

#: ../../docs/tutorials/export/exporting_for_ios.rst:105
msgid "**Location**: Relative to Project"
msgstr "**Location**：Relative to Project"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/export/exporting_for_ios.rst:106
msgid "**Build Rules**: Apply Once to Folder"
msgstr "**Build Rules**：Apply Once to Folder"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/export/exporting_for_ios.rst:107
msgid "add your project to **Target Membership**"
msgstr "將你的專案加入 **Target Membership**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/export/exporting_for_ios.rst:113
msgid ""
"Delete **exported_xcode_project_name.pck** from the Xcode project in the "
"project navigator."
msgstr ""
"從 Project 導覽器中的 Xcode 專案刪除 **exported_xcode_project_name.pck**。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/export/exporting_for_ios.rst:117
msgid ""
"8. Open **exported_xcode_project_name-Info.plist** and add a string property "
"named **godot_path** (this is the real key name) with a value "
"**godot_project_to_export** (this is the name of your project)"
msgstr ""
"8. 開啟 **exported_xcode_project_name-Info.plist** , 新增一個名為 "
"**godot_path** (這是真正的鍵名) 的字串屬性, 值設為 "
"**godot_project_to_export** (你的專案名稱)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/export/exporting_for_ios.rst:123
msgid ""
"That's it! You can now edit your project in the Godot editor and build it in "
"Xcode when you want to run it on a device."
msgstr ""
"就這樣！現在可以在 Godot 編輯器中編輯專案並於準備好在裝置上執行時於 Xcode 中"
"進行建置。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/export/exporting_for_ios.rst:127
#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/ios/plugins_for_ios.rst:6
