"port install gettext`` 指令。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_gettext.rst:60
msgid ""
"**Linux:** On most distributions, install the ``gettext`` package from your "
"distribution's package manager."
msgstr "**Linux：** 在大多數發行版上，請透過套件管理器安裝 ``gettext`` 套件。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/i18n/localization_using_gettext.rst:63
