"``void``, ``boolean``, ``int``, ``float``, ``java.lang.String``, "
"``org.godotengine.godot.Dictionary``, ``int[]``, ``byte[]``, ``float[]``, "
"``java.lang.String[]``."
msgstr ""
"請確認外掛暴露的方法僅使用以下 Java 型別：``void``、``boolean``、``int``、"
"``float``、``java.lang.String``、``org.godotengine.godot.Dictionary``、"
"``int[]``、``byte[]``、``float[]``、``java.lang.String[]``。"

