msgstr ""
":ref:`壓縮 64 位元整數陣列 <class_PackedInt64Array>` ： 64 位元整數的陣列。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.rst:936
msgid ""
":ref:`PackedFloat32Array <class_PackedFloat32Array>`: An array of 32-bit "
