#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/static_typing.rst:676
msgid ""
"Typed GDScript is a powerful tool. It helps you write more structured code, "
"avoid common errors, and create scalable and reliable systems. Static types "
"improve GDScript performance and more optimizations are planned for the "
"future."
msgstr ""
"靜態型別的 GDScript 是一項強大的工具。它能幫助你寫出結構更清晰的程式、減少常"
"見錯誤，並建立更具擴充性與可靠性的系統。靜態型別也能提升 GDScript 效能，未來"
"還會有更多最佳化。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/warning_system.rst:4
msgid "GDScript warning system"
msgstr "GDScript 警告系統"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/warning_system.rst:6
msgid ""
"The GDScript warning system complements :ref:`static typing "
"<doc_gdscript_static_typing>` (but it can work without static typing too). "
"It's here to help you avoid mistakes that are hard to spot during "
"development, and that may lead to runtime errors."
msgstr ""
"GDScript 警告系統能完善 :ref:`靜態型別 <doc_gdscript_static_typing>` （但即使"
"不使用靜態型別也能運作）。這個系統可以協助你在開發過程中發現難以察覺的錯誤，"
"避免這些錯誤在執行時發生。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/warning_system.rst:11
msgid ""
"You can configure warnings in the Project Settings under the section called "
"**GDScript**:"
msgstr "你可以在「專案設定」中的 **GDScript** 分類下設定警告選項："

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/warning_system.rst:17
msgid ""
"You must enable **Advanced Settings** in order to see the GDScript section "
"in the sidebar. You can also search for \"GDScript\" when Advanced Settings "
"is off."
msgstr ""
"必須啟用 **進階設定**，才能在側邊欄看到 GDScript 分類。若未啟用進階設定，也可"
"以直接搜尋「GDScript」。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/warning_system.rst:21
msgid ""
"You can find a list of warnings for the active GDScript file in the script "
"editor's status bar. The example below has 2 warnings:"
msgstr ""
"在腳本編輯器的狀態列上可以看到目前開啟的 GDScript 檔案所產生的警告。下方範例"
"中有兩個警告："

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/warning_system.rst:26
msgid ""
"To ignore single warnings within a file, use the :ref:`@warning_ignore "
"<class_@GDScript_annotation_@warning_ignore>` annotation. You can click on "
"the ignore link to the left of the warning's description. Godot will add an "
"annotation above the corresponding line and the code won't trigger the "
"corresponding warning anymore:"
msgstr ""
"若要在檔案中忽略單一警告，可以使用 :ref:`@warning_ignore "
"<class_@GDScript_annotation_@warning_ignore>` 標註。你也可以點擊警告描述左側"
"的忽略連結，Godot 會自動在對應行上方加入標註，該程式碼就不會再觸發該警告："

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/warning_system.rst:34
msgid ""
"To ignore multiple warnings in a region within a file, use "
"the :ref:`@warning_ignore_start "
"<class_@GDScript_annotation_@warning_ignore_start>` "
"and :ref:`@warning_ignore_restore "
"<class_@GDScript_annotation_@warning_ignore_restore>` annotations. You can "
"omit ``@warning_ignore_restore`` if you want to ignore the specified warning "
"types until the end of the file."
msgstr ""
"若要在檔案內的某個區塊忽略多個警告，可以使用 :ref:`@warning_ignore_start "
"<class_@GDScript_annotation_@warning_ignore_start>` "
"及 :ref:`@warning_ignore_restore "
"<class_@GDScript_annotation_@warning_ignore_restore>` 標註。如果想要忽略直到"
"檔案結尾，可以省略 ``@warning_ignore_restore``。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/warning_system.rst:40
msgid ""
"Warnings won't prevent the game from running, but you can turn them into "
"errors if you'd like. This way your game won't compile unless you fix all "
"warnings. Head to the ``GDScript`` section of the Project Settings to turn "
"on this option to the warning that you want. Here's the same file as the "
"previous example with the warning ``unused_variable`` as an error turned on:"
msgstr ""
"警告並不會阻止遊戲執行，但你可以選擇將警告視為錯誤。如此一來，除非修正所有警"
"告，否則專案將無法編譯。在「專案設定」的 ``GDScript`` 分類找到你想要設定的警"
"告類型，並啟用將此警告視為錯誤的選項。下方範例是將 ``unused_variable`` 警告設"
"為錯誤後的畫面："

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:4
msgid "GDScript format strings"
msgstr "GDScript 格式化字串"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:6
msgid ""
"Godot offers multiple ways to dynamically change the contents of strings:"
msgstr "Godot 提供多種方式可動態變更字串內容："

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:8
msgid "Format strings: ``var string = \"I have %s cats.\" % \"3\"``"
msgstr "格式化字串： ``var string = \"I have %s cats.\" % \"3\"``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:9
msgid ""
"The ``String.format()`` method: ``var string = \"I have {0} cats."
"\".format([3])``"
msgstr ""
"``String.format()`` 方法： ``var string = \"I have {0} cats.\".format([3])``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:10
msgid ""
"String concatenation: ``var string = \"I have \" + str(3) + \" cats.\"``"
msgstr "字串串接： ``var string = \"I have \" + str(3) + \" cats.\"``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:12
msgid ""
"This page explains how to use format strings, and briefly explains the "
"``format()`` method and string concatenation."
msgstr "本頁將說明如何使用格式化字串，並簡單介紹 ``format()`` 方法與字串串接。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:16
msgid "Format strings"
msgstr "格式化字串"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:18
msgid ""
"*Format strings* are a way to reuse text templates to succinctly create "
"different but similar strings."
msgstr "*格式化字串* 是用來重複利用文字樣板，簡潔地產生不同但類似字串的方法。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:21
msgid ""
"Format strings are just like normal strings, except they contain certain "
"placeholder character sequences such as ``%s``. These placeholders can then "
"be replaced by parameters handed to the format string."
msgstr ""
"格式化字串和一般字串類似，只是它們包含像 ``%s`` 這樣的預留位置符號。這些預留"
"位置可由傳入的參數取代。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:25
msgid "Examine this concrete GDScript example:"
msgstr "來看看這個實際的 GDScript 範例："

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:38
msgid ""
"Placeholders always start with a ``%``, but the next character or "
"characters, the *format specifier*, determines how the given value is "
"converted to a string."
msgstr ""
"預留位置總是以 ``%`` 開頭，接下來的字元稱為 *格式規範*，決定該值如何被轉換為"
"字串。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:42
msgid ""
"The ``%s`` seen in the example above is the simplest placeholder and works "
"for most use cases: it converts the value by the same method by which an "
"implicit String conversion or :ref:`str() <class_@GlobalScope_method_str>` "
"would convert it. Strings remain unchanged, booleans turn into either "
"``\"True\"`` or ``\"False\"``, an ``int`` or ``float`` becomes a decimal, "
"and other types usually return their data in a human-readable string."
msgstr ""
"上方範例中的 ``%s`` 是最簡單的預留位置，適用於大多數情境：它會以隱式 String "
"轉型或 :ref:`str() <class_@GlobalScope_method_str>` 相同的方式轉換值。字串會"
"保持不變，布林值會變成 ``\"True\"`` 或 ``\"False\"``，整數或浮點數會轉為十進"
"位，其他類型則會轉為人類可讀的字串。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:49
msgid "There are other `format specifiers`_."
msgstr "還有其他 `格式規範`_ 可用。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:52
msgid "Multiple placeholders"
msgstr "多重預留位置"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:54
msgid ""
"Format strings may contain multiple placeholders. In such a case, the values "
"are handed in the form of an array, one value per placeholder (unless using "
"a format specifier with ``*``, see `dynamic padding`_):"
msgstr ""
"格式化字串可以包含多個預留位置。此時，參數需以陣列方式傳入，每個預留位置對應"
"一個值（除非使用 ``*`` 格式規範，請見 `動態填充`_）："

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:66
msgid ""
"Note the values are inserted in order. Remember all placeholders must be "
"replaced at once, so there must be an appropriate number of values."
msgstr ""
"注意值會依序插入。請記得所有預留位置必須一次填滿，因此需要有正確數量的值。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:71
msgid "Format specifiers"
msgstr "格式規範"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:73
msgid ""
"There are format specifiers other than ``s`` that can be used in "
"placeholders. They consist of one or more characters. Some of them work by "
"themselves like ``s``, some appear before other characters, some only work "
"with certain values or characters."
msgstr ""
"除了 ``s`` 之外，預留位置還可以使用其他格式規範。格式規範可以是一個或多個字"
"元。有些像 ``s`` 一樣獨立使用，有些要搭配其他字元，有些則只適用於特定數值或字"
"元。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:80
msgid "Placeholder types"
msgstr "預留位置類型"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:82
msgid ""
"One and only one of these must always appear as the last character in a "
"format specifier. Apart from ``s``, these require certain types of "
"parameters."
msgstr ""
"格式規範最後一定要有下表其中一個（且僅能有一個）。除了 ``s`` 之外，其他規範都"
"需要特定型別的參數。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:86
msgid "``s``"
msgstr "``s``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:86
msgid ""
"**Simple** conversion to String by the same method as implicit String "
"conversion."
msgstr "**單純** 以隱式 String 轉型的方式轉換為字串。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:89
msgid "``c``"
msgstr "``c``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:89
msgid ""
"A single **Unicode character**. Accepts a Unicode code point (integer) or a "
"single-character string. Supports values beyond 255."
msgstr ""
"單一的 **Unicode 字元**。接受 Unicode 碼位（整數）或單一字元的字串。支援超過 "
"255 的值。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:92
msgid "``d``"
msgstr "``d``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:92
msgid ""
"A **decimal integer**. Expects an integer or a real number (will be floored)."
msgstr "**十進位整數**。需傳入整數或浮點數（小數部分會被無條件捨去）。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:95
msgid "``o``"
msgstr "``o``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:95
msgid ""
"An **octal integer**. Expects an integer or a real number (will be floored)."
msgstr "**八進位整數**。需傳入整數或浮點數（小數部分會被無條件捨去）。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:98
msgid "``x``"
msgstr "``x``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:98
msgid ""
"A **hexadecimal integer** with **lower-case** letters. Expects an integer or "
"a real number (will be floored)."
msgstr ""
"**小寫** 字母的 **十六進位整數**。需傳入整數或浮點數（小數部分會被無條件捨"
"去）。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:101
msgid "``X``"
msgstr "``X``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:101
msgid ""
"A **hexadecimal integer** with **upper-case** letters. Expects an integer or "
"a real number (will be floored)."
msgstr ""
"**大寫** 字母的 **十六進位整數**。需傳入整數或浮點數（小數部分會被無條件捨"
"去）。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:104
msgid "``f``"
msgstr "``f``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:104
msgid "A **decimal real** number. Expects an integer or a real number."
msgstr "**十進位實數**。需傳入整數或浮點數。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:106
msgid "``v``"
msgstr "``v``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:106
msgid ""
"A **vector**. Expects any float or int-based vector object ( ``Vector2``, "
"``Vector3``, ``Vector4``, ``Vector2i``, ``Vector3i`` or ``Vector4i``). Will "
"display the vector coordinates in parentheses, formatting each coordinate as "
"if it was an ``%f``, and using the same modifiers."
msgstr ""
"**向量**。需傳入任一以整數或浮點數為基礎的向量物件（如 ``Vector2``、"
"``Vector3``、``Vector4``、``Vector2i``、``Vector3i`` 或 ``Vector4i``）。會以"
"括號顯示向量座標，每個座標會以 ``%f`` 方式格式化，且可套用相同修飾元。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:115
msgid "Placeholder modifiers"
msgstr "預留位置修飾元"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:117
msgid ""
"These characters appear before the above. Some of them work only under "
"certain conditions."
msgstr "這些字元要放在格式規範前面。有些只在特定情況下有效。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:121
msgid "``+``"
msgstr "``+``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:121
msgid "In number specifiers, **show + sign** if positive."
msgstr "在數字格式規範中，若為正數則 **顯示 + 號**。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:123
msgid ""
"Set **padding**. Padded with spaces or with zeroes if integer starts with "
"``0`` in an integer or real number placeholder. The leading ``0`` is ignored "
"if ``-`` is present. When used after ``.``, see ``.``."
msgstr ""
"設定 **填充**。若在整數或實數預留位置中以 ``0`` 開頭，則以 0 填充，否則以空白"
"填充。若同時有 ``-``，則忽略前導 ``0``。若用於 ``.`` 之後，請見 ``.`` 說明。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:128
msgid "``.``"
msgstr "``.``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:128
msgid ""
"Before ``f`` or ``v``, set **precision** to 0 decimal places. Can be "
"followed up with numbers to change. Padded with zeroes."
msgstr ""
"在 ``f`` 或 ``v`` 前面時，將 **精度** 設為 0 小數位。可以在後面加數字更改小數"
"位數。以 0 進行填充。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:131
msgid "``-``"
msgstr "``-``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:131
msgid "**Pad to the right** rather than the left."
msgstr "**向右填充**，而非向左填充。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:133
msgid "``*``"
msgstr "``*``"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:133
msgid ""
"**Dynamic padding**, expects additional integer parameter to set padding or "
"precision after ``.``, see `dynamic padding`_."
msgstr ""
"**動態填充**，會預期額外的整數參數來設定填充或 ``.`` 後的精度，請見 `動態填充"
"`_。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:139
msgid "Padding"
msgstr "填充"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:141
msgid ""
"The ``.`` (*dot*), ``*`` (*asterisk*), ``-`` (*minus sign*) and digit (``0``-"
"``9``) characters are used for padding. This allows printing several values "
"aligned vertically as if in a column, provided a fixed-width font is used."
msgstr ""
"``.``（點）、``*``（星號）、``-``（減號）及數字（``0``-``9``）可用於填充。若"
"搭配等寬字型，可讓多個值垂直對齊，像表格一樣。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:146
msgid "To pad a string to a minimum length, add an integer to the specifier:"
msgstr "若要將字串填充至最小長度，可在格式規範中加整數："

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:154
msgid ""
"If the integer starts with ``0``, integer values are padded with zeroes "
"instead of white space:"
msgstr "若整數以 ``0`` 開頭，則會以 0 填充整數值，而非空白："

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:162
msgid ""
"Precision can be specified for real numbers by adding a ``.`` (*dot*) with "
"an integer following it. With no integer after ``.``, a precision of 0 is "
"used, rounding to integer values. The integer to use for padding must appear "
"before the dot."
msgstr ""
"對於實數，可在格式規範中加上 ``.``（點）及整數來指定精度。若 ``.`` 後未加數"
"字，則精度為 0（四捨五入為整數）。用來填充的整數必須寫在點之前。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:174
msgid ""
"The ``-`` character will cause padding to the right rather than the left, "
"useful for right text alignment:"
msgstr "``-`` 字元會讓填充改為向右（右對齊），方便右側對齊字串："

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:185
msgid "Dynamic padding"
msgstr "動態填充"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:187
msgid ""
"By using the ``*`` (*asterisk*) character, the padding or precision can be "
"set without modifying the format string. It is used in place of an integer "
"in the format specifier. The values for padding and precision are then "
"passed when formatting:"
msgstr ""
"使用 ``*`` （星號）可讓你不用修改格式化字串本身，就能動態設定填充或精度。它會"
"取代格式規範中的整數，並於格式化時傳入填充或精度的數值："

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:200
msgid ""
"It is still possible to pad with zeroes in integer placeholders by adding "
"``0`` before ``*``:"
msgstr "若要在整數預留位置用 0 填充，則可在 ``*`` 前加上 ``0``："

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:210
msgid "Escape sequence"
msgstr "跳脫字元"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:212
msgid ""
"To insert a literal ``%`` character into a format string, it must be escaped "
"to avoid reading it as a placeholder. This is done by doubling the character:"
msgstr ""
"若要將字面上的 ``%`` 字元插入格式化字串，必須跳脫它，避免被解析為預留位置。這"
"可透過連續輸入兩個 ``%`` 達成："

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:223
msgid "String format method"
msgstr "字串格式化方法"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:225
msgid ""
"There is also another way to format text in GDScript, namely "
"the :ref:`String.format() <class_String_method_format>` method. It replaces "
"all occurrences of a key in the string with the corresponding value. The "
"method can handle arrays or dictionaries for the key/value pairs."
msgstr ""
"GDScript 也支援另一種格式化字串的方式，就是 :ref:`String.format() "
"<class_String_method_format>` 方法。它會將字串中出現的所有索引鍵，替換為對應"
"的值。這個方法可以處理陣列或字典型態的索引鍵／值組。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:230
msgid ""
"Arrays can be used as key, index, or mixed style (see below examples). Order "
"only matters when the index or mixed style of Array is used."
msgstr ""
"陣列可以作為索引鍵、索引，或混合樣式使用（請見下方範例）。只有在用索引或混合"
"樣式時才需注意順序。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:233
msgid "A quick example in GDScript:"
msgstr "GDScript 的簡易範例："

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:248
msgid "Format method examples"
msgstr "格式化方法範例"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:250
msgid ""
"The following are some examples of how to use the various invocations of the "
"``String.format()``  method."
msgstr "以下展示各種方式呼叫 ``String.format()`` 方法的範例。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:254
#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:276
msgid "**Type**"
msgstr "**型別**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:254
msgid "**Style**"
msgstr "**樣式**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:254
#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_format_string.rst:276
