"定其他內容。對於每個類別都要呼叫 ``GDREGISTER_RUNTIME_CLASS`` 巨集，代表它們"
"只會在遊戲執行時註冊，這與 GDScript 預設行為相同。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_cpp_example.rst:272
msgid ""
"You can find information about ``GDREGISTER_CLASS`` (and alternatives) "
"at :ref:`doc_object_class`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/cpp/gdextension_cpp_example.rst:274
msgid ""
"The important function is the third function called "
"``example_library_init``. We first call a function in our bindings library "
