#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdextension/index.rst:6
msgid "The GDExtension system"
msgstr "GDExtension 系統"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdextension/index.rst:8
#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdextension/what_is_gdextension.rst:6
msgid ""
"**GDExtension** is a Godot-specific technology that lets the engine interact "
"with native `shared libraries <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Library_(computing)#Shared_libraries>`__ at runtime. You can use it to run "
"native code without compiling it with the engine."
msgstr ""
"**GDExtension** 是 Godot 專用的技術，允許引擎在執行時與原生 `共用函式庫 "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Library_(computing)#Shared_libraries>`__ 互"
"動。你可以利用它在不需要重新編譯引擎的情況下執行原生程式碼。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdextension/index.rst:12
msgid ""
"GDExtension is *not* a scripting language and has no relation "
"to :ref:`GDScript <doc_gdscript>`."
msgstr ""
"GDExtension *不是* 指令碼語言，也與 :ref:`GDScript <doc_gdscript>` 無關。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdextension/index.rst:15
msgid ""
"This section describes how GDExtension works, and is generally aimed at "
"people wanting to make a GDExtension from scratch, for example to create "
"language bindings. If you want to use existing language bindings, please "
"refer to other articles instead, such as the articles about :ref:`C++ (godot-"
"cpp) <doc_godot_cpp>` or one of the :ref:`community-made ones "
"<doc_what_is_gdnative_third_party_bindings>`."
msgstr ""
"本節介紹 GDExtension 的運作方式，主要面向想要從零實作 GDExtension（例如建立語"
"言綁定）的人。如果你只想使用現有的語言綁定，請參閱其他文章，例如 :ref:`C++"
"（godot-cpp） <doc_godot_cpp>` 或其中一個 :ref:`社群製作的綁定 "
"<doc_what_is_gdnative_third_party_bindings>`。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdextension/what_is_gdextension.rst:4
msgid "What is GDExtension?"
msgstr "什麼是 GDExtension？"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdextension/what_is_gdextension.rst:10
msgid "There are three primary methods with which this is achieved:"
msgstr "要達成這點主要有三種方式："

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdextension/what_is_gdextension.rst:12
msgid ""
"``gdextension_interface.h``: A set of C functions that Godot and a "
"GDExtension can use to communicate."
msgstr ""
"``gdextension_interface.h``：一組 C 函式，供 Godot 與 GDExtension 彼此溝通使"
"用。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdextension/what_is_gdextension.rst:13
msgid ""
"``extension_api.json``: A list of C functions that are exposed from Godot "
"APIs (:ref:`Core Features <doc_scripting_core_features>`)."
msgstr ""
"``extension_api.json``：由 Godot API（:ref:`核心功能 "
"<doc_scripting_core_features>`）對外提供的一系列 C 函式清單。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdextension/what_is_gdextension.rst:14
msgid ""
":ref:`*.gdextension <doc_gdextension_file>`: A file format read by Godot to "
"load a GDExtension."
msgstr ""
":ref:`*.gdextension <doc_gdextension_file>`：Godot 讀取以載入 GDExtension 的"
"檔案格式。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdextension/what_is_gdextension.rst:16
msgid ""
"Most people create GDExtensions with some existing language binding, such "
"as :ref:`godot-cpp (for C++) <doc_godot_cpp>`, or one of the :ref:`community-"
"made ones <doc_what_is_gdnative_third_party_bindings>`."
msgstr ""
"多數人會使用既有的語言綁定來建立 GDExtension，例如 :ref:`godot-cpp（C++） "
"<doc_godot_cpp>`，或是 :ref:`社群製作的綁定 "
"<doc_what_is_gdnative_third_party_bindings>`。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdextension/what_is_gdextension.rst:22
msgid ""
"See :ref:`godot-cpp Version Compatibility "
"<doc_what_is_gdextension_version_compatibility>`, which applies to all "
"GDExtensions."
msgstr ""
"請參閱 :ref:`godot-cpp 版本相容性 "
"<doc_what_is_gdextension_version_compatibility>`，該內容同樣適用於所有 "
"GDExtension。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdextension/gdextension_file.rst:4
msgid "The .gdextension file"
msgstr ".gdextension 檔案"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdextension/gdextension_file.rst:9
msgid ""
"The ``.gdextension`` file in your project contains the instructions for how "
"to load the GDExtension. The instructions are separated into specific "
"sections. This page should give you a quick overview of the different "
"options available to you. For an introduction how to get started with C++ "
"(godot-cpp), take a look at the :ref:`GDExtension C++ Example "
"<doc_godot_cpp_getting_started>`."
msgstr ""
"專案中的 ``.gdextension`` 檔案包含如何載入 GDExtension 的指示。這些指示被分成"
"多個特定區段。本頁會快速總覽你可用的不同選項。若要了解如何開始使用 C++"
"（godot-cpp），請參閱 :ref:`GDExtension C++ 範例 "
"<doc_godot_cpp_getting_started>`。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdextension/gdextension_file.rst:15
msgid "Configuration section"
msgstr "設定區段"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdextension/gdextension_file.rst:18
msgid "Property"
msgstr "屬性"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdextension/gdextension_file.rst:20
msgid "**entry_symbol**"
msgstr "**entry_symbol**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdextension/gdextension_file.rst:20
msgid ""
"Name of the entry function for initializing the GDExtension. This function "
"should be defined in the ``register_types.cpp`` file when using godot-cpp. "
"Adding this is necessary for the extension to work."
msgstr ""
"初始化 GDExtension 的進入點函式名稱。使用 godot-cpp 時，此函式應定義於 "
"``register_types.cpp`` 檔案中。若未設定，擴充功能將無法正常運作。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdextension/gdextension_file.rst:24
msgid "**compatibility_minimum**"
msgstr "**compatibility_minimum**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdextension/gdextension_file.rst:24
msgid ""
"Minimum compatible version. This prevents older versions of Godot from "
"loading extensions that depend on features from newer versions of Godot. "
"**Only supported in Godot 4.1 or later**"
msgstr ""
"最低相容版本。此設定可避免舊版 Godot 嘗試載入需要新版功能的擴充功能。**僅支援"
"於 Godot 4.1 或更新版本**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdextension/gdextension_file.rst:27
msgid "**compatibility_maximum**"
msgstr "**compatibility_maximum**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdextension/gdextension_file.rst:27
msgid ""
"Maximum compatible version. This prevents newer versions of Godot from "
"loading the extension. **Only supported in Godot 4.3 or later**"
msgstr ""
"最高相容版本。此設定可避免新版 Godot 嘗試載入本擴充功能。**僅支援於 Godot "
"4.3 或更新版本**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdextension/gdextension_file.rst:30
msgid "**reloadable**"
msgstr "**reloadable**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdextension/gdextension_file.rst:30
#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdextension/gdextension_file.rst:34
#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/visual_shaders.rst:143
msgid "Boolean"
msgstr "布林"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdextension/gdextension_file.rst:30
msgid ""
"Reloads the extension upon recompilation. Reloading is supported for the "
"godot-cpp binding in Godot 4.2 or later. Other language bindings may or may "
"not support it as well. This flag should be mainly used for developing or "
"debugging an extension."
msgstr ""
"重新編譯時自動重新載入擴充功能。於 Godot 4.2 或更新版本的 godot-cpp 綁定支援"
"此功能。其他語言綁定可能不支援。此旗標主要用於擴充功能的開發與除錯階段。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdextension/gdextension_file.rst:34
msgid "**android_aar_plugin**"
msgstr "**android_aar_plugin**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdextension/gdextension_file.rst:34
msgid ""
"The GDExtension is part of a :ref:`v2 Android plugin <doc_android_plugin>`. "
"During export this flag will indicate to the editor that the GDExtension "
"native shared libraries are exported by the Android plugin AAR binaries."
msgstr ""
"此 GDExtension 屬於 :ref:`v2 Android 外掛 <doc_android_plugin>` 的一部分。匯"
"出時，此旗標會通知編輯器該 GDExtension 的原生共享函式庫由 Android 外掛的 AAR "
"檔案負責匯出。"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdextension/gdextension_file.rst:40
msgid "Libraries section"
msgstr "函式庫區段"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdextension/gdextension_file.rst:42
msgid ""
"In this section you can set the paths to the compiled binaries of your "
"GDExtension libraries. By specifying feature flags you can filter which "
"version should be loaded and exported with your game depending on which "
"feature flags are active. Every feature flag must match to Godot's feature "
"flags or your custom export flags to be loaded in an exported game. For "
"instance ``macos.debug`` means that it will be loaded if Godot has both the "
"``macos`` and ``debug`` flag active. Each line of the section is evaluated "
"from top to bottom."
msgstr ""
"在本區段中，你可以設定 GDExtension 函式庫的編譯二進位檔路徑。透過指定功能旗"
"標，可以依據目前啟用的旗標，決定要載入與匯出哪個版本。每個功能旗標必須與 "
"Godot 的功能旗標或自訂匯出旗標相符，才能在匯出遊戲時正確載入。例如 "
"``macos.debug`` 表示只有在 Godot 啟用 ``macos`` 與 ``debug`` 旗標時才會載入。"
"區段中的每一行會自上而下依序判斷。"

