#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/common_engine_methods_and_macros.rst:158
msgid "Get project/editor settings"
msgstr "取得專案／編輯器設定"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/common_engine_methods_and_macros.rst:160
msgid "There are four macros available for this:"
msgstr "可用於此的巨集有四種："

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/common_engine_methods_and_macros.rst:172
msgid ""
"If a default value has been specified elsewhere, don't specify it again to "
"avoid repetition:"
msgstr "若預設值已於其他地方指定，請勿重複指定以避免冗餘："

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/common_engine_methods_and_macros.rst:182
msgid ""
"It's recommended to use ``GLOBAL_DEF``/``EDITOR_DEF`` only once per setting "
"and use ``GLOBAL_GET``/``EDITOR_GET`` in all other places where it's "
"referenced."
msgstr ""
"建議每個設定僅用一次 ``GLOBAL_DEF``／``EDITOR_DEF``，其他需要使用時則以 "
"``GLOBAL_GET``／``EDITOR_GET`` 讀取。"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/common_engine_methods_and_macros.rst:188
msgid "Error macros"
msgstr "錯誤巨集"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/common_engine_methods_and_macros.rst:190
msgid ""
"Godot features many error macros to make error reporting more convenient."
msgstr "Godot 提供多種錯誤巨集，讓錯誤回報更加便利。"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/common_engine_methods_and_macros.rst:194
msgid ""
"Conditions in error macros work in the **opposite** way of GDScript's built-"
"in ``assert()`` function. An error is reached if the condition inside "
"evaluates to ``true``, not ``false``."
msgstr ""
"錯誤巨集中的條件判斷方式與 GDScript 內建的 ``assert()`` 函式**相反**。當條件"
"式為 ``true`` 時就會觸發錯誤，而非 ``false``。"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/common_engine_methods_and_macros.rst:200
msgid ""
"Only variants with custom messages are documented here, as these should "
"always be used in new contributions. Make sure the custom message provided "
"includes enough information for people to diagnose the issue, even if they "
"don't know C++. In case a method was passed invalid arguments, you can print "
"the invalid value in question to ease debugging."
msgstr ""
"這裡僅說明帶有自訂訊息的變體，因為建議所有新貢獻都應優先使用這些形式。請確保"
"自訂訊息中包含足夠資訊，即使不懂 C++ 也能協助診斷問題。若方法收到無效參數，也"
"可印出該值以便除錯。"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/common_engine_methods_and_macros.rst:206
msgid ""
"For internal error checking where displaying a human-readable message isn't "
"necessary, remove ``_MSG`` at the end of the macro name and don't supply a "
"message argument."
msgstr ""
"若僅需內部錯誤檢查且不需要顯示人類可讀訊息，可將巨集名稱結尾的 ``_MSG`` 移"
"除，並省略訊息參數。"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/common_engine_methods_and_macros.rst:210
msgid ""
"Also, always try to return processable data so the engine can keep running "
"well."
msgstr "同時，請盡量回傳可處理的資料，以便引擎可以正常持續運作。"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/common_engine_methods_and_macros.rst:254
msgid ""
"See `core/error/error_macros.h <https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/"
"master/core/error/error_macros.h>`__ in Godot's codebase for more "
"information about each error macro."
msgstr ""
"更多各錯誤巨集的詳細資訊，請參見 Godot 原始碼中的 `core/error/error_macros.h "
"<https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/core/error/"
"error_macros.h>`__。"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/common_engine_methods_and_macros.rst:257
msgid ""
"Some functions return an error code (materialized by a return type of "
"``Error``). This value can be returned directly from an error macro. See the "
"list of available error codes in `core/error/error_list.h <https://"
"github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/core/error/error_list.h>`__."
msgstr ""
"部分函式會回傳錯誤碼（以 ``Error`` 型別呈現）。這個值可直接由錯誤巨集回傳。可"
"用的錯誤碼列表請參考 `core/error/error_list.h <https://github.com/"
"godotengine/godot/blob/master/core/error/error_list.h>`__。"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/core_types.rst:6
msgid ""
"Godot has a rich set of classes and templates that compose its core, and "
"everything is built upon them."
msgstr "Godot 具有一套豐富的類別與範本，構成其核心，所有功能皆建立於此之上。"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/architecture/core_types.rst:9
msgid ""
"This reference will try to list them in order for their better understanding."
msgstr "本參考資料將依序列出這些型別，幫助使用者更好地理解。"

