#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_godot_servers.rst:36
msgid "Creating a Godot server"
msgstr "建立 Godot 伺服器"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_godot_servers.rst:38
msgid ""
"At minimum, a server must have a static instance, a sleep timer, a thread "
"loop, an initialization state and a cleanup procedure."
msgstr ""
"最低需求下，伺服器必須具備靜態實體、睡眠計時器、執行緒循環、初始化狀態與清理"
"程序。"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_godot_servers.rst:41
msgid "hilbert_hotel.h"
msgstr "hilbert_hotel.h"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_godot_servers.rst:93
msgid "hilbert_hotel.cpp"
msgstr "hilbert_hotel.cpp"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_godot_servers.rst:236
msgid "prime_255.h"
msgstr "prime_255.h"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_godot_servers.rst:268
msgid "Custom managed resource data"
msgstr "自訂受管理的資源資料"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_godot_servers.rst:270
msgid ""
"Godot servers implement a mediator pattern. All data types inherit "
"``RID_Data``. ``RID_Owner<MyRID_Data>`` owns the object when ``make_rid`` is "
"called. During debug mode only, RID_Owner maintains a list of RIDs. In "
"practice, RIDs are similar to writing object-oriented C code."
msgstr ""
"Godot 伺服器實現了中介者模式。所有資料型別都繼承自 ``RID_Data``。當呼叫 "
"``make_rid`` 時，``RID_Owner<MyRID_Data>`` 會擁有該物件。僅在除錯模式下，"
"RID_Owner 會維護一份 RID 清單。實務上，RID 的概念近似於以物件導向方式撰寫 C "
"語言。"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_godot_servers.rst:275
msgid "infinite_bus.h"
msgstr "infinite_bus.h"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_godot_servers.rst:313
msgid ":ref:`RID<class_rid>`"
msgstr ":ref:`RID<class_rid>`"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_godot_servers.rst:317
msgid "Registering the class in GDScript"
msgstr "在 GDScript 註冊類別"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_godot_servers.rst:319
msgid ""
"Servers are allocated in ``register_types.cpp``. The constructor sets the "
"static instance and ``init()`` creates the managed thread; "
"``unregister_types.cpp`` cleans up the server."
msgstr ""
"伺服器會在 ``register_types.cpp`` 中進行配置。建構子會設定靜態實體，而 "
"``init()`` 會建立受管理的執行緒；``unregister_types.cpp`` 則負責清理伺服器。"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_godot_servers.rst:323
msgid ""
"Since a Godot server class creates an instance and binds it to a static "
"singleton, binding the class might not reference the correct instance. "
"Therefore, a dummy class must be created to reference the proper Godot "
"server."
msgstr ""
"由於 Godot 伺服器類別建立實體並綁定至靜態單例，直接繫結類別可能無法正確參照實"
"體。因此，必須建立一個虛擬類別以參照正確的 Godot 伺服器。"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_godot_servers.rst:327
msgid ""
"In ``register_server_types()``, ``Engine::get_singleton()->add_singleton`` "
"is used to register the dummy class in GDScript."
msgstr ""
