"這兩者可任意放置，只要在 SCons 編譯時提供正確路徑即可。"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/cross-compiling_for_ios_on_linux.rst:115
msgid ""
"For the iPhone platform to be detected, you need the ``OSXCROSS_IOS`` "
"environment variable defined to anything."
msgstr ""
"為讓 SCons 能正確偵測到 iPhone 平台，需設置 ``OSXCROSS_IOS`` 環境變數（內容可"
"任意設）。"

#: ../../docs/engine_details/development/compiling/cross-compiling_for_ios_on_linux.rst:122
